  "text": "Motion is a language. Before an animation is code, it is a decision about feeling. This skill gives your agent three pillars. Emotional intent, visual narrative, motion craft. Every element gets a personality. Playful bounces, premium glides. Corporate is clean and certain. Energetic overshoots and snaps back. Timing comes from tables, not guesses. A tooltip lands in one hundred milliseconds. A modal takes three fifty. Choreography leads with the hero and staggers the rest under half a second. And the rules hold it all together. Never linear, never opacity alone. Three layers of motion every time. The Motion Design Skill by Lottie Files. One install away.",
